{
  "text": "Level one starts with ten million dollars. But by Level eight, our modern billionaires look completely broke. And Level ten will break your brain. This is the ultimate wealth comparison. From the modern millionaire to the richest human who ever lived. Let's start the countdown! Level one: The Tech Millionaire. Coming in at ten million dollars! To the average person, this is retirement on easy mode. But on our ladder, it doesn't even move the needle! Level two: Cristiano Ronaldo. Jumping to two hundred fifty million dollars! Five Ballon d'Or trophies, global endorsements, and private jets! But he is just warming up the arena! Level three: The Silicon Valley Unicorn Founder. One billion dollars! Welcome to the three-comma club! But we are just getting started! Level four: Warren Buffett. One hundred forty billion dollars! The Oracle of Omaha holds more wealth than entire sovereign nations! Level five: Jeff Bezos. Two hundred ten billion dollars! Look at the numbers climb! Amazon delivers across the entire globe, and Bezos takes the number five spot! Level six: Elon Musk. Two hundred fifty billion dollars! Rockets, electric vehicles, satellite networks! Musk is the undisputed king of the modern world! But here is the catch: he is not even close to the top of history! Level seven: John D. Rockefeller. Adjusted for inflation, three hundred forty billion dollars! Rockefeller controlled ninety percent of American oil! His wealth represented nearly two percent of the entire US economy! Level eight: Andrew Carnegie. Three hundred seventy billion dollars! HE OVERTAKES ROCKEFELLER! Carnegie steel built the modern skyscraper skyline! Level nine: Jakob Fugger. Four hundred billion dollars! The Renaissance banker who funded emperors, popes, and kings! He controlled nearly ten percent of Europe's entire wealth! And now... Level ten. The final apex. Mansa Musa. Emperor of Mali. Estimated at over four hundred billion dollars. In truth, his wealth was literally immeasurable. In 1324, he journeyed to Mecca with tons of pure gold. He gave away so much in Cairo that you could feel the economic collapse across the entire Mediterranean for a decade! If you stacked his gold today, no modern billionaire could ever touch this record. The debate is over. The champion has been crowned. And the numbers have settled it. Which level surprised you the most? Drop your vote in the comments below, subscribe to The Comparison Arena, and tell us which extreme showdown we should run next!",
